{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44129824",
      "title": "Creating Multi-Input Validators / Form Group Validators",
      "lectureOrder": 264,
      "videoOrder": 252,
      "sourceHash": "42e115ecf37982e7df5016de4364c8520f95381ddd38d3fd4788a59da2ba5340",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.57,
          "end": 1.83,
          "en": "So how can we set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.83,
          "end": 5.07,
          "en": "such a combined validator?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.07,
          "end": 9.3,
          "en": "Well, it's extremely easy if you put the controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.3,
          "end": 13.419,
          "en": "that should be checked in combination into a forum group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.419,
          "end": 18.419,
          "en": "Because, and that's new, a forum group also takes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.72,
          "end": 21.48,
          "en": "a second argument, which is a configuration object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.48,
          "end": 25.24,
          "en": "And here you can also register validators.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.24,
          "end": 30.24,
          "en": "Validators that will now run for the overall forum group",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.57,
          "end": 34.11,
          "en": "because it turns out that a forum group is also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.11,
          "end": 36.81,
          "en": "in the end a forum control, just a special kind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.81,
          "end": 38.79,
          "en": "of control, you could say, that consists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.79,
          "end": 40.443,
          "en": "of multiple controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.4,
          "end": 43.23,
          "en": "But since that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.23,
          "end": 47.4,
          "en": "we can add a new validation function here outside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.4,
          "end": 49.62,
          "en": "of the component for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.62,
          "end": 54.62,
          "en": "and I'll name it, \"equalPasswords,\" or \"equalValues\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.739,
          "end": 59.01,
          "en": "to make it a bit more generic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.01,
          "end": 61.89,
          "en": "And this function, since it will act",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.89,
          "end": 65.07,
          "en": "as a validator function, will receive a control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.07,
          "end": 68.57900000000001,
          "en": "which will be of type abstract control just as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.57900000000001,
          "end": 72.27,
          "en": "because such a forum group turns out to be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.27,
          "end": 76.47800000000001,
          "en": "of that type just as the forum control objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.47800000000001,
          "end": 80.916,
          "en": "And in here, I then want to get my password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.916,
          "end": 85.916,
          "en": "by accessing control dot what?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 86.16,
          "end": 91.16,
          "en": "How do I now get hold of my password control?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 91.34100000000001,
          "end": 96.34100000000001,
          "en": "Well, we can't access control.controls.password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 96.75,
          "end": 98.739,
          "en": "because TypeScript doesn't know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 98.739,
          "end": 102.69,
          "en": "what this abstract control will be.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 102.69,
          "end": 105.27000000000001,
          "en": "It doesn't know that it will be a forum group",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 105.27000000000001,
          "end": 108.92,
          "en": "which has a nested password control inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 108.92,
          "end": 111.72,
          "en": "Now we know that this will be the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 113.88,
          "en": "but we can't access it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 113.88,
          "end": 115.713,
          "en": "TypeScript doesn't allow that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 116.57900000000001,
          "end": 120.21,
          "en": "But thankfully all those control objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 120.21,
          "end": 122.85,
          "en": "also give us a GET method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 122.85,
          "end": 126.27,
          "en": "And this GET method takes the name of a control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.27,
          "end": 129.39,
          "en": "and it will then search for that control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 129.39,
          "end": 131.699,
          "en": "So in this case, password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 131.699,
          "end": 136.413,
          "en": "So that will give me the password control if it exists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 136.413,
          "end": 139.683,
          "en": "Otherwise GET will return null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 140.931,
          "end": 144.296,
          "en": "So it will either give me that control it found or null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 144.296,
          "end": 146.85,
          "en": "but here I know that it should find a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.85,
          "end": 149.22,
          "en": "and therefore I'll access that value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 149.22,
          "end": 151.8,
          "en": "But you should add this question mark to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.8,
          "end": 155.04,
          "en": "in the end, tell TypeScript and JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.04,
          "end": 158.67000000000002,
          "en": "that this might be null, and that the value property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.67000000000002,
          "end": 162,
          "en": "should only be accessed if it's not null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 162,
          "end": 163.89,
          "en": "So password therefore will be null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.89,
          "end": 167.054,
          "en": "if no password control was found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.054,
          "end": 170.52,
          "en": "Otherwise it will be that value that was entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.52,
          "end": 172.71699999999998,
          "en": "into the password input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.71699999999998,
          "end": 176.673,
          "en": "and the confirmed password can be retrieved in the same way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 177.555,
          "end": 179.22,
          "en": "Of course now I wanna look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.22,
          "end": 182.82,
          "en": "for the confirmed password control though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 182.82,
          "end": 186.783,
          "en": "and these names here must be the names you chose down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.913,
          "end": 191.34,
          "en": "So now we have the two values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 191.34,
          "end": 194.37,
          "en": "Now we can use them, and we can check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 194.37,
          "end": 198.72,
          "en": "if password is equal to confirmed password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 198.72,
          "end": 201.03,
          "en": "So if they are equal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 201.03,
          "end": 205.74,
          "en": "In that case, at least from this validator's point of view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 205.74,
          "end": 208.743,
          "en": "the values are valid and I'll return null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 209.7,
          "end": 212.73,
          "en": "Otherwise I'll return such an error object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 212.73,
          "end": 217.73,
          "en": "where I'll set passwords not equal to true, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 221.337,
          "end": 226.05,
          "en": "And now we can use this equal values validator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 226.05,
          "end": 228.18,
          "en": "We can go down here to the validators",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 228.18,
          "end": 230.43,
          "en": "of this passwords forum group,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 230.43,
          "end": 232.743,
          "en": "and add the validator like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 233.97,
          "end": 238.71,
          "en": "Now with that, this forum group will be validated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 238.71,
          "end": 241.89,
          "en": "but what's important to understand now is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 241.89,
          "end": 246.03,
          "en": "that those validation classes will also be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 246.03,
          "end": 248.55,
          "en": "to the forum group or to the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 248.55,
          "end": 250.41,
          "en": "that's linked to the forum group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 250.41,
          "end": 252.153,
          "en": "So in this case to this div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 253.731,
          "end": 255.72,
          "en": "Therefore, if you save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 255.72,
          "end": 258.24,
          "en": "and you go back, and you enter long passwords",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 258.24,
          "end": 262.293,
          "en": "that are not equal, you don't get any error feedback here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 263.28,
          "end": 265.74,
          "en": "Because if you inspect the DOM you'll see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 265.74,
          "end": 270.74,
          "en": "that Angular did add its classes, but it added them here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 270.851,
          "end": 274.793,
          "en": "to this div that groups these controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 274.793,
          "end": 278.34000000000003,
          "en": "That div where I added this forum group name directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 278.34000000000003,
          "end": 281.733,
          "en": "And here indeed this is marked as invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 282.6,
          "end": 285.09000000000003,
          "en": "So our validator seems to work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 285.09000000000003,
          "end": 289.44,
          "en": "we just don't have any CSS classes that in the end rely",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 289.44,
          "end": 292.923,
          "en": "on NG valid being added to the surrounding element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 294.81,
          "end": 299.19,
          "en": "But we can change this by going to the styles CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 299.19,
          "end": 303.12,
          "en": "and by editing it and attached you find an updated version",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 303.12,
          "end": 305.61,
          "en": "which already has all the changes you need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 305.61,
          "end": 308.43,
          "en": "So you can replace your styles.css code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 308.43,
          "end": 310.113,
          "en": "with the one you find attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 311.55,
          "end": 316.05,
          "en": "If you replace your styles.css file with the attached one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 316.05,
          "end": 318.6,
          "en": "if you go back and you enter long passwords",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 318.6,
          "end": 321.993,
          "en": "that are not equal, they will be marked as invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 321.993,
          "end": 326.46,
          "en": "And only if you enter the same valid password values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 326.46,
          "end": 329.94,
          "en": "will that styling go away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 329.94,
          "end": 331.65,
          "en": "And that now of course proves",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 331.65,
          "end": 334.473,
          "en": "that our custom validator works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 334.473,
          "end": 337.59000000000003,
          "en": "Now we can actually enhance that validator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 337.59000000000003,
          "end": 339.188,
          "en": "and make it a bit more generic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 339.188,
          "end": 343.59000000000003,
          "en": "by actually creating a validator factory here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 343.59000000000003,
          "end": 345.12,
          "en": "Because at the moment of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 345.12,
          "end": 349.95,
          "en": "this equal values validator looks for exactly a password,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 349.95,
          "end": 352.413,
          "en": "and a confirmed password control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 353.31,
          "end": 356.27,
          "en": "Now what we could do is we could make",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 356.27,
          "end": 361.097,
          "en": "this equal values function return a function where it's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 361.097,
          "end": 366.097,
          "en": "that returned function that receives the abstract control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 368.41,
          "end": 372.66,
          "en": "and that then contains this code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 372.66,
          "end": 375.21,
          "en": "But equal values could now take",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 375.21,
          "end": 380.21,
          "en": "the two control names, control name 1 and control name 2,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 381.39,
          "end": 385.067,
          "en": "which should both be of type string, as inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 385.067,
          "end": 389.83,
          "en": "And we could then use them here, control name 1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 389.83,
          "end": 393.483,
          "en": "and control name 2 in our code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 394.92,
          "end": 398.79,
          "en": "And maybe rename the constants here to val1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 398.79,
          "end": 403.08299999999997,
          "en": "and val2, val1 and val2.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 403.92,
          "end": 407.043,
          "en": "And the error code to values not equal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 408.42,
          "end": 410.82,
          "en": "With that, we now have a factory function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 410.82,
          "end": 413.49,
          "en": "that produces a value data function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 413.49,
          "end": 415.77,
          "en": "but it produces that function based",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 415.77,
          "end": 419.694,
          "en": "on some input we pass to the factory function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 419.694,
          "end": 424.451,
          "en": "And that allows us to now execute equal values here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 424.451,
          "end": 429.451,
          "en": "just as minLength is a factory function that's executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 429.51,
          "end": 431.73,
          "en": "to pass our configuration to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 431.73,
          "end": 436.19,
          "en": "in this case to pass the two control names to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 436.19,
          "end": 439.17,
          "en": "And it's then these names that will be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 439.17,
          "end": 441.813,
          "en": "in the produced validator function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 443.34,
          "end": 446.19,
          "en": "With that, if you reload, this will still work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 446.19,
          "end": 449.73,
          "en": "as it did before, and valid values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 449.73,
          "end": 452.37,
          "en": "that are equal will still be accepted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 452.37,
          "end": 454.53,
          "en": "But now we could theoretically use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 454.53,
          "end": 457.5,
          "en": "this equal values validator function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 457.5,
          "end": 462.5,
          "en": "to compare any two forum controls and not just passwords.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 462.81,
          "end": 465.54,
          "en": "So that's something you might wanna do if you plan",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 465.54,
          "end": 468.273,
          "en": "on using that on other controls as well.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
